# Every `tk` subcommand entrypoint.sh and preflight.sh invoke, one per line.
#
# DERIVED, not maintained by hand: it is exactly what
# factory.EntrypointTkCommands() reads out of those two scripts, and
# TestRequiredTkCommandsFileMatchesTheEntrypoint fails the build when the two
# drift. It exists as a file because the image build reads it too — the last
# layer of the Dockerfile runs every line against the tk it just built, so an
# image whose tk predates one of these fails to build instead of booting a
# container that dies mid-run with "unknown command".
